CONFIDENTIALITY NOTICE

This repository contains ARCHITECTURE DOCUMENTATION ONLY.

**What This Repository IS:**
- Educational system architecture documentation
- Design patterns and orchestration concepts
- Placeholder examples for Django + FastAPI integration
- Documentation of YOLO training and inference workflows

**What This Repository IS NOT:**
- Production source code
- Runnable application code
- Real proprietary algorithms
- Real training datasets or model weights

**Sanitization Standards:**
All content follows strict public-release standards:
- ✓ No real company names or customer information
- ✓ No IP addresses, hostnames, or internal domain names
- ✓ No credentials (API keys, passwords, tokens)
- ✓ No real production metrics from proprietary systems
- ✓ No trained model weights or datasets
- ✓ All references use placeholder values

**For Contributors:**
See CONTRIBUTING.md for mandatory sanitization guidelines.
All pull requests must pass:
  - bash validate-sanitization.sh
  - bash complete-sanitization-check.sh

**For Repositories:**
See docs/16-public-release-sanitization.md for comprehensive sanitization guide.

